/* AI-Noether: KeyMaera Reasoning Template (Noisy Case)
 * 
 * This template verifies that the abducted axioms (with existentially quantified
 * coefficients) can derive the noisy consequence (also with existentially 
 * quantified coefficients).
 *
 * Structure:
 * - Variables are universally quantified (forall)
 * - Monomial coefficients are existentially quantified (exists)
 * - Known axioms appear as exact equations
 * - Abducted axioms have coefficients c1, c2, ... for each monomial
 * - Consequence has coefficients d1, d2, ... for each monomial
 */

